---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout 
  title="Pesan Terkirim" 
  description="Terima kasih, pesan Anda telah berhasil dikirimkan dengan enkripsi aman ke Aurelius & Associates Law Office."
>

  <section class="section-padding" style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-bg-white) 0%, var(--color-bg-alabaster) 100%); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: calc(100vh - 200px);">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 600px; text-align: center;">
      
      <!-- Thank You Glassmorphism Card -->
      <div class="glass-panel" style="padding: 4rem 3rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); border-color: var(--color-gold); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); position: relative;">
        
        <!-- Glowing Checkmark icon -->
        <div style="width: 72px; height: 72px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1.5px solid var(--color-gold); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--color-gold-dark); background-color: var(--color-bg-white); margin-bottom: 2rem; box-shadow: var(--shadow-gold-glow);">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" style="width: 36px; height: 36px;">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5" />
          </svg>
        </div>

        <span class="badge-gold">Submisi Sukses</span>
        <h2 class="text-center" style="margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.85rem; color: var(--color-text-primary);">
          Kueri Kepatuhan Terkirim
        </h2>
        
        <p style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: 2rem; font-weight: 300;">
          Terima kasih. Berkas kasus dan informasi kontak Anda telah terkirim secara aman ke server kami. Seluruh dokumen yang dikirim dilindungi sepenuhnya oleh <strong>Hak Istimewa Advokat-Klien (Attorney-Client Privilege)</strong> demi kerahasiaan mutlak.
        </p>

        <div style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-light); padding-top: 2rem; margin-top: 2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; align-items: center;">
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-text-light); margin: 0;">
            Representatif hukum senior kami akan meninjau berkas Anda dan menghubungi dalam waktu maksimal 2 jam.
          </p>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; margin-top: 0.5rem;">
            <a href="/" class="btn btn-gold-outline" style="padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem;">
              Kembali ke Beranda
            </a>
            <a href="tel:+6285171605225" class="btn btn-red-pulse" style="padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem;">
              Panggilan Darurat
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</MainLayout>
